    "Result": "Little Leo's lessons.Little Leo liked drawing very much. His friends all liked his pictures. You're going to be an artist, Leo. They always said little Leo took drawing lessons. In the first lesson, the teacher put an egg on the table and asked little Leo to draw it.That's easy, said little Leo. In the second lesson, the teacher still asked him to draw an egg, but he put the egg on a plate. Little Leo felt unhappy and asked why do we draw eggs all the time? Look carefully. It's an egg again, but it looks different, said the teacher. Little Leo worked hard and became a great artist.",
